    "mode": "underspecified",
    "reason": "Two distinct users satisfy the real_name substring 'alex': Alex Rivera (U200) and Alexandra Cho (U201). Each reacts to a message in a different audit channel belonging to a different workspace, so 'Alex' resolves to two competing individuals whose reactions certify two different, non-overlapping roster-membership sets. Nothing in the request delegates a choice between them.",
